@startuml Contract Lifecycle State Machine
!theme plain
title PaymentContract State Machine (Early Order Creation)

[*] --> DRAFT : createContract()

DRAFT --> NOT_FINISHED : EarlyOrderCreationHandler\ncreateOrder() + transitionToNotFinished(orderId)
note right of DRAFT
  Contract created with:
  - BasketSnapshot
  - Conditions (payment_authorized)
  - No order yet (OXORDERID = NULL)
end note

NOT_FINISHED --> PENDING : transitionToPending()
note right of NOT_FINISHED
  Order created early:
  - OXORDERID set
  - order_number in metadata
  - Order exists in oxorder table
end note

NOT_FINISHED --> CANCELLED : cancel()

PENDING --> AUTHORIZED : authorize()\n[two-step capture]
PENDING --> READY_TO_COMMIT : fulfillAllConditions()\n[immediate capture]
PENDING --> FAILED : fail()
PENDING --> CANCELLED : cancel()
note right of PENDING
  Awaiting payment:
  - Stripe Checkout Session created
  - Order number in Stripe metadata
  - User redirected to Stripe
end note

AUTHORIZED --> READY_TO_COMMIT : fulfillAllConditions()
AUTHORIZED --> CANCELLED : voidAuthorization()
AUTHORIZED --> FAILED : fail()
note right of AUTHORIZED
  Two-step capture flow:
  - Payment authorized but not captured
  - Manual capture from admin
end note

READY_TO_COMMIT --> COMMITTED : commit()
READY_TO_COMMIT --> CANCELLED : cancel()
READY_TO_COMMIT --> FAILED : fail()
note right of READY_TO_COMMIT
  Payment confirmed:
  - All conditions fulfilled
  - Ready for order finalization
end note

COMMITTED --> FULFILLED : fulfill()
COMMITTED --> FAILED : fail()
note right of COMMITTED
  Order finalized:
  - StripeOrderCreationHandler detects\n  existing order (skips creation)
  - Updates OXTRANSID with PaymentIntent ID
  - Sets OXPAID timestamp
end note

FULFILLED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of FULFILLED
  Terminal success state:
  - Payment captured
  - Order fully processed
  - OXPAID set
end note

state DRAFT #LightBlue
state NOT_FINISHED #LightYellow
state PENDING #LightYellow
state AUTHORIZED #Orange
state READY_TO_COMMIT #LightGreen
state COMMITTED #LightGreen
state FULFILLED #Green
state CANCELLED #LightCoral
state EXPIRED #LightCoral
state FAILED #LightCoral

legend right
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  | <#LightBlue> | Initial |
  | <#LightYellow> | In Progress |
  | <#Orange> | Authorized (2-step) |
  | <#LightGreen> | Ready/Committed |
  | <#Green> | Success |
  | <#LightCoral> | Terminal Error |
endlegend

@enduml
